<title>USA: Central Parking Corp Q4 net rises.</title>
<headline>Central Parking Corp Q4 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>NASHVILLE, Tenn. 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fourth Quarter Ended</p>
<p>						 Sep 30,	    Sep 30,</p>
<p>						   1996		 1995</p>
<p> Total revenues			$36,881,000	$32,749,000</p>
<p> Net earnings			    3,436,000	  2,382,000</p>
<p> Net earnings per share		     0.20		 0.15</p>
<p> Weighted average common shares   17,588,000	 15,372,000</p>
<p>							 Year Ended</p>
<p>						 Sep 30,	    Sep 30,</p>
<p>						    1996		1995</p>
<p> Total revenues		     $143,316,000     $126,155,000</p>
<p> Net earnings			   13,836,000	  9,944,000</p>
<p> Net earnings per share		     0.79		 0.65</p>
<p>Net gain per share after taxes</p>
<p>						    0.04	$	   -</p>
<p> Weighted average common shares   17,491,000	 15,372,000</p>
<p>Note:  The share and per share amounts have been adjusted to reflect the three-for-two stock split distributed in March 1996.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
</text>
